<title>FRANCE: Carrefour shares rise on January sales.</title>
<headline>Carrefour shares rise on January sales.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in retailer Carrefour rose on Wednesday after the group reported a 10.5 percent rise in sales for January.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 2.7 percent at 3,350 francs at 1130 GMT.</p>
<p>Traders said the results revived interest in the share, which had underperformed the bourse last month. &quot;The market is applauding the sales rise...The stock had lagged the bourse,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
